{
  "_comment": [
    "Local configuration for codes/picode_paths.py. Copy to picode_local.json",
    "and fill in. It is gitignored, because it names working directories on one",
    "machine and nothing in it is needed to reproduce the paper.",
    "",
    "Only the two scripts that execute the unpublished pI-code scoring code need",
    "this file: codes/extract_edge_costs.py and codes/asic_edge_vs_cost.py.",
    "Every other script resolves the ladder edges, the residue charges and the",
    "burial thresholds from data/ladder_definition.json and",
    "data/burial_thresholds.json, which are committed, so a clone runs without",
    "this file and without those folders.",
    "",
    "path   relative to an ancestor of the project root, or absolute.",
    "marker a file that must exist inside the folder for it to be accepted.",
    "search_parents  optional intermediate folders to try under each ancestor."
  ],
  "search_parents": [""],
  "method":  {"path": "/absolute/or/relative/path/to/method/folder", "marker": "a-file-inside-it"},
  "memctrl": {"path": "/path/to/the/folder/holding/data/humsavar.txt", "marker": "data/humsavar.txt"},
  "lpo":     {"path": "/path/to/the/folder/holding/the/burial/script", "marker": "the-burial-script.py"}
}
